{
  "_comment": "DDE for Debian。目标是 Debian forky（14, testing）：trixie(13) 的 Qt 6.8.2 缺 Qt 6.9 私有 API、libwayland 只有 1.23、libdrm 2.4.124、libpixman 0.44、wayland-protocols 1.44，导致 qt6-wayland/dtkcore/dtkgui/dde-wlroots 均无法构建。enabled=true 才会被构建。repo 为 github.com 下的 owner/name，ref 为分支或 tag。source=git 表示从 GitHub 拉源码；source=apt 表示从 apt 源 apt source。depends 里的名字必须是本清单内的包；分层由 scripts/gen_matrix.py 按依赖自动计算。",
  "suite": "forky",
  "codename": "dde26",
  "packages": [
    {
      "name": "wlr-protocols",
      "repo": "deepin-community/wlr-protocols",
      "ref": "master",
      "source": "git",
      "enabled": true,
      "depends": [],
      "_note": "Wayland 协议 XML。Debian trixie 完全没有这个包，但 qwlroots/waylib/treeland 都要它"
    },
    {
      "name": "treeland-protocols",
      "repo": "linuxdeepin/treeland-protocols",
      "ref": "master",
      "source": "git",
      "enabled": true,
      "depends": [],
      "_note": "treeland 私有 Wayland 协议；trixie 只有 0.4.5，treeland 要 >=0.8.0，所以自建"
    },
    {
      "name": "wlroots",
      "repo": "deepin-community/wlroots",
      "ref": "master",
      "source": "git",
      "enabled": true,
      "depends": [],
      "_note": "产出 libwlroots-0.19 / -dev。forky 适配见 patches/wlroots-forky-compat.patch：①libinput 1.31 新枚举未被 switch 处理、②新头文件触发大量新警告 → 关闭 -Dwerror",
      "source_patches": [
        "patches/wlroots-forky-compat.patch"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "qt6-wayland",
      "repo": "deepin-community/qt6-wayland",
      "ref": "master",
      "source": "git",
      "enabled": false,
      "depends": [],
      "not_installed": [
        "usr/lib/*/qt6/sbom/*",
        "usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/qt6/sbom/qtwayland-6.8.0.spdx"
      ],
      "_note": "deepin 补丁版（含 QtKeyExtensionGlobal）。**当前不构建**：它是 Qt 6.8 源码，forky 的 qtbase 6.11 私有头不兼容（qwaylandcompositor.h 直接语法错），Qt Wayland 模块必须与 qtbase 同版本。DTK 链只需要 distro 的 qt6-wayland-dev，够用。treeland 要 QtKeyExtensionGlobal 时再想办法（移植补丁到 6.11 或自建 Qt 6.8 栈）。"
    },
    {
      "name": "dtkcommon",
      "repo": "linuxdeepin/dtkcommon",
      "ref": "master",
      "source": "git",
      "enabled": true,
      "depends": [],
      "_note": "DTK 基础库，依赖少，是 DTK 链的根"
    },
    {
      "name": "dtklog",
      "repo": "linuxdeepin/dtklog",
      "ref": "master",
      "source": "git",
      "enabled": true,
      "depends": [],
      "_note": "产出 libdtk6log-dev 6.7.54。trixie 只有 0.0.2，而 dtkcore 要求 >>6.7.33"
    },
    {
      "name": "qwlroots",
      "repo": "vioken/qwlroots",
      "ref": "master",
      "source": "git",
      "enabled": true,
      "depends": [
        "wlroots",
        "wlr-protocols"
      ],
      "_note": "wlroots 的 Qt 绑定。注意上游已迁到 vioken/，linuxdeepin/qwlroots 不存在"
    },
    {
      "name": "dtkcore",
      "repo": "linuxdeepin/dtkcore",
      "ref": "master",
      "source": "git",
      "enabled": true,
      "depends": [
        "dtkcommon",
        "dtklog"
      ],
      "_note": "含 DConfig。单元测试直接用 Qt 私有 API（ut_dcapfsfileengine 里的 entryList/TriStateResult），Qt 6.11 已改，DEB_BUILD_OPTIONS=nocheck 只跳过运行不跳过编译 → 直接关 BUILD_TESTING",
      "source_patches": [
        "patches/dtkcore-disable-unit-tests.patch"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "waylib",
      "repo": "vioken/waylib",
      "ref": "master",
      "source": "git",
      "enabled": true,
      "depends": [
        "qwlroots",
        "wlroots",
        "wlr-protocols"
      ],
      "_note": "treeland 依赖，基于 wlroots + QtQuick。forky 适配：①关闭 examples/tests（tinywl 链接 Waylib::WaylibServer 失败）②Qt 6.11 不再导出 <Module>_PRIVATE_INCLUDE_DIRS 或私有 CMake target → 从 Qt6::Gui include 根推导版本化私有头目录",
      "source_patches": [
        "patches/waylib-no-examples.patch",
        "patches/waylib-qt611-private-headers.patch",
        "patches/waylib-unistd.patch",
        "patches/waylib-theme-support.patch"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "dtkgui",
      "repo": "linuxdeepin/dtkgui",
      "ref": "master",
      "source": "git",
      "enabled": true,
      "depends": [
        "dtkcore"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "dtkwidget",
      "repo": "linuxdeepin/dtkwidget",
      "ref": "master",
      "source": "git",
      "enabled": true,
      "depends": [
        "dtkgui"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "dtkdeclarative",
      "repo": "linuxdeepin/dtkdeclarative",
      "ref": "master",
      "source": "git",
      "enabled": true,
      "depends": [
        "dtkwidget",
        "dtkgui"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "dde-wlroots",
      "repo": "linuxdeepin/dde-wlroots",
      "ref": "master",
      "source": "git",
      "enabled": true,
      "depends": [],
      "_note": "静态编译 wlroots 0.20.2 给 treeland 用。trixie 的版本要求（libwayland>=1.26 / libdrm>=2.4.134 / libpixman>=0.46.4）在 forky 全部满足"
    },
    {
      "name": "ddm",
      "repo": "linuxdeepin/ddm",
      "ref": "master",
      "source": "git",
      "enabled": true,
      "depends": [
        "dtkcore",
        "treeland-protocols"
      ],
      "_note": "deepin Qt 重写版 ddm。forky 没有 systemd.pc，CMake 4 下目录变量为空导致 install(FILES) 报错",
      "source_patches": [
        "patches/ddm-systemd-pkgconfig.patch"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "dde-application-manager",
      "repo": "linuxdeepin/dde-application-manager",
      "ref": "master",
      "source": "git",
      "enabled": false,
      "depends": [
        "dtkcore"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "dde-daemon",
      "repo": "linuxdeepin/dde-daemon",
      "ref": "master",
      "source": "git",
      "enabled": false,
      "depends": []
    },
    {
      "name": "treeland",
      "repo": "linuxdeepin/treeland",
      "ref": "master",
      "source": "git",
      "enabled": false,
      "depends": [
        "waylib",
        "dde-wlroots",
        "treeland-protocols",
        "dtkcore",
        "dtkdeclarative",
        "ddm"
      ],
      "_note": "会话层核心。当前卡在 dde-wlroots 的基础库版本要求"
    },
    {
      "name": "dde-tray-loader",
      "repo": "linuxdeepin/dde-tray-loader",
      "ref": "master",
      "source": "git",
      "enabled": false,
      "depends": [
        "dtkwidget"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "dde-shell",
      "repo": "linuxdeepin/dde-shell",
      "ref": "master",
      "source": "git",
      "enabled": false,
      "depends": [
        "dtkdeclarative",
        "dde-application-manager",
        "dde-tray-loader"
      ],
      "_note": "上游自带 debian/；注意 USE_DEEPIN_QT 探测"
    },
    {
      "name": "dde-control-center",
      "repo": "linuxdeepin/dde-control-center",
      "ref": "master",
      "source": "git",
      "enabled": false,
      "depends": [
        "dtkdeclarative",
        "dde-daemon"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "dde-file-manager",
      "repo": "linuxdeepin/dde-file-manager",
      "ref": "master",
      "source": "git",
      "enabled": false,
      "depends": [
        "dtkwidget",
        "dde-daemon"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "dde-launchpad",
      "repo": "linuxdeepin/dde-launchpad",
      "ref": "master",
      "source": "git",
      "enabled": false,
      "depends": [
        "dtkdeclarative"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "dde-session-shell",
      "repo": "linuxdeepin/dde-session-shell",
      "ref": "master",
      "source": "git",
      "enabled": false,
      "depends": [
        "dtkwidget",
        "dtkdeclarative"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
